~ MetalSlug01/Source/MetalSlug01/Private/Weapons/RangedLineStrategy.cpp
 ~ Phase 2 LoS 校验: PawnLoc → PawnAimPoint (ClosestPointOnPath)
 + 显式 if (LateralDistance ≤ 30cm && !bLoSBlocked) 合并判定
